{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【C108】《棕色塵埃2》攤位報導！一如既往的高品質 Cosplay 讓粉絲熱血沸騰</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/739548ec109ba8f7172174e20c86c7e17aeb9e6addc662615d49bd975f88eb58/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd1f37cfead88470c1cd8b9377f706500.jpg\"/><p>2026年8月15日（六）、16日（日）正在日本舉辦的同人誌即賣會「 Comic Market 108 」 這次要為大家帶來「 棕色塵埃2 」攤位的現場報導！</p><h3>話題不斷的「棕色塵埃2」攤位</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6eb9dafe6d5eff899559324676fe67da3f9a70957bda1d5c405c4833693fba22/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F02e8a738f455c8d9e7d6b324aacb4a5b.jpg\"/><p>滿載胸中熱情的 RPG 手遊「棕色塵埃2 @BROWNDUST2_JP )」</p><p>非常有 Comic Market風格的周邊販售攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/019dffd5e0c68f7c7a59b13e3a5f3e0e913a2cc117d971b4ec2a68cb2c30e517/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa946206745318ceb7932acd257283121.jpg\"/><p>在東京 Big Sight 南4展廳2641號的棕色塵埃2攤位，現場設有 Cosplayer 舞台及周邊販售等活動。</p><p>賭場！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/688262e57e09d453feeaa36d247c1ef2be9c299304af41b9cdf52c404de7917b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2dc42f04b89903bd6e3d0c68caa70aff.jpg\"/><p>可以使用購買周邊獲得的籌碼挑戰賭場遊戲。 以獲得貼紙、摺疊傘等豪華贈品為目標吧！</p><p>也別忘了拿購物袋</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/18530146ef74c9f8a3b2f307a6b8e5d3e8c2e02a175bff225f715f31dcbbb670/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6ef964f3a313f10f727a91efdcef27d0.jpg\"/><p>第一天預計由東雲海( @sinonome_umi )小姐登台，第二天則有めるぱるめ( @meruparume )小姐、折紙小姐、進藤天音( @amane_bushi )小姐作為特別嘉賓登場！ 感覺現場又要聚集一大群人了……</p><h3>Cosplay 舞台</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fbed4027d906ad3a3dfa7aa81b7750a5c3621c8fa10d49e9595cfcc5443ae200/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F25bc551f6491b5ee6a94230f4e6739d8.jpg\"/><p>當然也有 Cosplay 舞台！ 棕色塵埃2攤位每年都是現場人潮數一數二的熱門攤位，因此很容易就能找到。</p><p>莎赫拉查德 / 吉田早希</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e90f84c4d66c8d4422ecd549d0c5ac1a8a15bc3d6be0586059d0e63f787b3d06/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0c5058b9f8b7c7cddb29cbccac1408a6.jpg\"/><p>X: @yoshida_saki</p><p>Instagram: @mt_yoshida</p><p>米卡艾拉 / 雪花</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4b85ab057cef1d2e115e8830b30b04d5f0822482fb21a101bdb9208c9e13b199/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F30012e15b6ed98a6b93abf73346d0e3a.jpg\"/><p>X: @godseolhwa</p><p>Instagram: @god.seolhwa</p><p>內布里斯 / 篠崎こころ</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/39693ea40cfcc1c58fd602690175868bb11fb02f126c39362b588e5934cafa2c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcf3ac9ffe1fe8bbe584da6977cfe4824.jpg\"/><p>X: @kokoro777pp</p><p>Instagram: @kokoro777pp</p><p>愛麗潔 / チロルちゃん</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bf5966d482ac41a04331f84a8aebfeed9d8cd25f0af4714dc61947b77f769c0a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F52e186c0af8321cdc6cae3180f7cee37.jpg\"/><p>X: @mmmlmmm2</p><p>Instagram: @chiroru_cosp</p><p>妮坎達莉亞 / かえるちゃん</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7fe1192d904a37804f4b9d08f50e1e6923b2a23ad1b4a1b16f4f750b4649d450/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3a5a1d73db70b8aeab1ca4f4fd742a54.jpg\"/><p>X: @0910kaeru</p><p>Instagram: @0910kaeru</p><p>盧班希亞 / 米倉みゆ</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/68c989bd629e69212198313000f359d85952093b6f6f1921c9618e33ad93ea48/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbc5597cd3814d7a2fd42806f493dbdc1.jpg\"/><p>X: @0630_miyu_</p><p>Instagram: @yone__san630</p><p>葛蘭希爾德 / えい梨</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/97c2bd4c01b1c9b5325ac1a42587c59c2c3e101c79f025cbc0a4c07400020dda/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3fc37e495f4f9a36d585e78d933554e3.jpg\"/><p>X: @kaorokuri</p><p>Instagram: @00shiga00</p><p>達里安 / Hane Ame</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/314ce6e076547bc2840d272cbe2603e3941982d2565de78c2783ca292f08de36/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc421e65c21e9eb93c0a0138d1c549b49.jpg\"/><p>X: @haneame_cos</p><p>Instagram: @haneame_cos</p><p>馬莫尼爾 / みぃこ</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8238effc44390e75d5b4fe677a200f130b9522721bf80f3552bc14f0880b98cf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1733fced30c7d3599c2149c265f99b85.jpg\"/><p>X: @mmm_mii_</p><p>Instagram: @mmm_mii_</p><p>🔸【C108】《勝利女神：妮姬》攤位報導！夏日祭典風格佈置登場 Cosplay 攝影會盛況空前 🔸【C108】《嘟嘟臉惡作劇》攤位報導！斯皮奇在Comic Market大量出沒 混亂場面讓路人紛紛停下腳步 🔸台灣・高雄首次舉辦日本最大級Cosplay活動「acosta!」！兩天內有1萬5千名Cosplayer與攝影師到場 🔸「ユリコタイガー（Yuriko Tiger）」宣布離開所屬事務所 METEORA st. 未來將以自由身份持續活動 🔸【TGS2026】「棕色塵埃2」攤位報導！可愛又性感的Coser令人目不轉睛</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T02:37:58.537669+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1209,"images":15,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}